  "//": "pstack's per-role model choices, owned here instead of by /setup-pstack. Rendered by bin/sync-pstack into pstack/{cursor,claude,opencode}/; do not edit those by hand. The role labels are the ones in the pinned setup-pstack step 5, and bin/sync-pstack reports drift when upstream renames one.",
